#: ../../source/reference/obbox.rst:13
msgid ""
"An arbitrarily oriented bounded volume in space in the form of a "
"rectangular parallelepiped (Bounding Box). Unlike AABB, OBB rotates with "
"the object and does not change its size. Collision testing with OBB is "
"somewhat more complicated and slower than AABB, but more often it is more"
" preferable. Oriented Bounding Box represented by center of box, size and"
" rotation quaternion."
msgstr ""

